      "questionType": "概念与原理",
      "origin": "自行整理",
      "question": "WebSocket 与 Server-Sent Events 的主要通信方式有什么区别？",
      "answer": "WebSocket 建立连接后支持双向消息；SSE 的事件流主要从服务器单向发送给客户端。",
      "explanation": "SSE 应用仍可通过其他 HTTP 请求发送客户端数据。",
      "example": "聊天双向交互与服务端状态推送。",
      "tags": [
        "WebSocket 与服务端事件",
        "通信方式"
      ],
      "evidence": "source",
      "reference": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6455.html",
      "supportingReferences": [
        {
          "id": "whatwg-sse",
          "title": "WHATWG HTML：Server-sent events",
          "url": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/server-sent-events.html",
          "type": "Web 标准",
          "evidence": "source"
