      "questionType": "概念与原理",
      "origin": "自行整理",
      "question": "RFC 6455 的 WebSocket 初始握手怎样从 HTTP/1.1 切换协议？",
      "answer": "客户端发送包含 Upgrade 的握手请求，服务器接受时以 101 Switching Protocols 响应。",
      "explanation": "其他 HTTP 版本的 WebSocket 建立方式需参照相应扩展规范。",
      "example": "HTTP/1.1 GET 请求请求升级为 websocket。",
      "tags": [
        "WebSocket 与服务端事件",
        "握手升级"
      ],
      "evidence": "source",
      "reference": "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6455.html"
